  "bodyHash": "e455447e925ee7df",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">MORECOSMETICS</span><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>MoreCosmetics 為 Minecraft 增添了各種飾品，例如帽子、翅膀、盾牌與披風。<br>所有內容皆<strong>免費</strong>且完全可自訂！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">前往<strong>皮膚自訂</strong>或按下<strong>M</strong>鍵以開啟 MoreCosmetics 介面。<br>您可以在設定中更改快捷鍵。</span><br><br></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">宣傳影片</span><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KW4chAILhlo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">功能特色</span><br><br></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>免費披風</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">上傳您自己的貼圖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">所有 MoreCosmetics 使用者皆可見<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>免費飾品</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">可透過色彩設定等功能進行完整自訂<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>建立專屬飾品</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">搭配 Blockbench 與我們的 MoreCosmetics 外掛使用（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmorecosmetics.org%252fcosmetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">morecosmetics.org/cosmetics</a>）<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>內建貼圖庫</strong><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">直接內建超過 1000 種設計<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>名稱標籤功能</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">提供多種樣式與字型供您選擇<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>多客戶端支援</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">MoreCosmetics 也透過&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmorecosmetics.org%252fdownload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安裝程式</a>支援原版客戶端</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>使用教學<br></strong></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5lEsqpzGWiQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更多詳細資訊請造訪&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmorecosmetics.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">morecosmetics.org</a>。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
